# fixtures/generated/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The .calc.xlsx files hold values LibreOffice computed, and the tests assert
# against them: they are the oracle, not a build artifact. Regenerating them on
# each CI run would mean the assertions quietly change with whatever LibreOffice
# version the runner happens to carry, which is the opposite of a reference.
# Committing them also keeps CI hermetic - no Python, no LibreOffice, no apt.
# Regenerate deliberately with `npm run fixtures` and review the diff.
.vite/
.turbo/
scratch-tmp/
